YouTube has said it is investigating after the UK government called on the Google-owned platform to remove Russell Brand 's prison message video.

On Sunday, Brand&#x2019;s wife, Laura Brand, delivered some words on behalf of her husband on the Forgetting Sarah Marshall star&#x2019;s YouTube channel. In the message, Brand maintained that he was innocent of rape and sexual assault.

